            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justices questioned whether the rights under the Plant Variety Protection statute differ from those under the patent statute and whether a farmer who replants saved seed would infringe the patent."
      }
