            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Bruce E. Johnson, the case concerns whether patents on corn plant varieties are invalid because Congress created a separate statutory scheme \u2013 the Plant Variety Protection (PVP) system \u2013 to protect such living things."
      }
    ],
